<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About" description="About Psi Research Bulletins.">
  <article class="article shell-narrow">
    <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Critical and accessible research monitoring</h1></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Psi Research Bulletins covers recent work in parapsychology, anomalistics, metascience and consciousness studies. It aims to provide a rigorous resource for readers who want to follow the field while distinguishing novelty, evidence and interpretation.</p>
      <p>This is a personal, independent project. It may later be transferred to or associated with an editorial partner without changing the addresses of articles already published.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
